{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15107030","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15107030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510702001:":{"text":"軍隊？どこに行くのでしょうか？","source_cn":"军队？他们要去哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x528954AF70A4EB2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510702002:":{"text":"このロンゴス、今より兵を率いて――","source_cn":"副将隆尔领命出兵——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFD19CB3E50D2C5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510702003:":{"text":"獣人を討ち、樹怒の谷を征服する！","source_cn":"讨伐兽人，占领树怒山谷！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61207543342CFF7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510702004:":{"text":"皆殺しよ！","source_cn":"杀光他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB70AF4605A7D7545","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510702005:":{"text":"必ず勝ってお戻りください！","source_cn":"一定要凯旋啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75B7F1E6B3BA952A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510702006:":{"text":"同胞の仇を取ってくれ！","source_cn":"替死去的人报仇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BACCDE1AF9BC25C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510703001:0":{"text":"まさか、樹怒の谷に攻め入るつもりなのですか……！？","source_cn":"他们要进攻树怒山谷……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDEC581FE168B47A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510703002:0":{"text":"どうだろうな。あの若い領主がしびれを切らしたんじゃないのか？","source_cn":"谁知道呢？可能那位年轻的领主想速战速决？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF08D180B3B1072C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510703003:0":{"text":"確かに領主はアバルドですが、議事官や貴族といった牽制し合う勢力によって、思うように施策を進められないと聞いています。","source_cn":"阿邦德虽是领主，但他的命令被议事官与诸多贵族掣肘，各方...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC77C5601BF89F25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510703004:0":{"text":"特に洪水によって民心が揺らいでいる今、出兵には皆を納得させるだけの理由が必要です。","source_cn":"尤其是在洪水之后。在人心动荡时出兵，要想不被指控枉顾人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x387609115FECF285","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1510703001":{"text":"まさか、樹怒の谷に攻め入るつもりなのですか……！？","source_cn":"他们要进攻树怒山谷……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDEC581FE168B47A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510703005:0":{"text":"これだけの兵が動いているのに、司令官がいないなんて……あまりにも不自然です。","source_cn":"军队出征声势浩大，统帅却不在队伍里……这太反常了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD1B7EDF23B0BDC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510703006:0":{"text":"きっと、ホーリンどもは他にも何か企んでるんだろう。","source_cn":"呼临人一定有别的计谋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F4388DE4A327D12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510703007:0":{"text":"そいつを探すぞ。奴らの思い通りにはさせない！","source_cn":"得找到他。无论呼临人想做什么，都不能让他们得逞！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D3B76BABF22BDA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"ペルセウスの姿が見えない……","source_cn":"没看到珀尔修斯","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDFD6C5843D0DA949","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ペルセウスの姿が見えない……","female":"ペルセウスの姿が見えない……","variant_male_record_index":"77134","variant_female_record_index":"77135","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510703008:0":{"text":"……奴は消えました。","source_cn":"……他消失了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEE9618F352E7AC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":